      "text": "Hello! How's everything today?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 11.51,
      "end": 18.91,
      "text": "Not many classic board games do, but party games handle it well. Word guessing in teams or hidden role games scale up nicely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 22.1,
      "end": 28.67,
      "text": "Games where a few people are secretly the bad guys and everyone else has to work out who. They're great for big groups and short rounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 31.49,
      "end": 37.39,
      "text": "Then a team drawing or acting game is gentler. Nobody's on the spot alone, and shy people can just guess."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reply",
      "start": 42.73,
      "end": 47.7,
      "text": "Mix it with smaller tables too, two or three games running at once, and let people move between them."
